# GRUB SHIFT: a hivebug grows up with a drone beside it and can't be hurt
# while the drone is next to it. Shove the drone away and it dies (no kill
# counted), then the hivebug pops.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 4
cheat bug 3 1 2 0
cheat rest
wait 120
expect lv_at31 == 1
expect drones == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 2 3
cheat bug 4 3 2 1
cheat bug 5 2 7 0
cheat use 5 4 3
expect kills == 0
expect bug_at43 == 2
cheat tilly 5 3
cheat use 0 5 2
expect drones == 0
expect kills == 0
cheat tilly 4 1
cheat use 6 4 3
expect kills == 1
